<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 12-mth T-bill yield rises to 19.69 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 12-mth T-bill yield rises to 19.69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's 12-month discount Treasury bills was set by auction at 19.69 percent, up from 19.64 percent set at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     33,540.73 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   16,999.98 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		22,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.69 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     83.5868 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
